# Maven dependency:analyze baseline for the multi-module CrewScope build.
# Format: <diagnostic-kind>|<groupId>:<artifactId>
#
# The analyzer reports transitive framework implementation classes as
# "used-undeclared" even when the owning starter intentionally supplies them.
# These entries are reviewed with each dependency change. A new coordinate must
# be promoted to a direct dependency or explicitly documented here in the same PR.
